OL,3,GNEWSAWest Highland railway line to
OL,4,Aclose in November for #13m upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe West Highland Line is due to close
OL,7,Ffor nine days in November for a #13m
OL,8,Fupgrade.
OL,10,FThe scenic railway line, linking
OL,11,FGlasgow to destinations including Oban
OL,12,Fand Mallaig, features the famous
OL,13,FGlenfinnan Viaduct seen in the Harry
OL,14,FPotter films.
OL,16,FNetwork Rail will carry out work at
OL,17,Flocations between Helensburgh, Fort
OL,18,FWilliam and Mallaig.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
