OL,3,GNEWSAWest Highland railway line to
OL,4,Aclose in November for #13m upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the work would tackle wear and
OL,7,Ftear, make the route more resilient in
OL,8,Fperiods of severe weather and reduce
OL,9,Fthe risk of delays and restrictions.
